  "reason": "The assistant asserts a false premise that contradicts the provided reference: UVG Art. 3(2) specifies coverage ends 31 days after the right to at least half salary ends (or 31 days after unemployment benefits were last drawn), not automatically up to 90 days until the next job. The assistant invents a rule not present in the reference and generalizes incorrectly.",
  "evidence": "Ja, des stimmt im Prinzip. In de meischte Fälle witerläuft d Unfällversicherung automatisch bis zum Afang vom nächste Beschäftigungsverhältnis, also maximal 90 Täg lang."
